    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "Dive into nature and go hiking on Koh Tao to discover hidden beauty, secret beaches, and stunning secluded viewpoints.",
        "main_title": "Spotlight Koh Tao 2025 at Sairee Beach",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "There is so much more to explore on Koh Tao than our snorkel and scuba diving sites. Hiking on Koh Tao is becoming increasingly popular, and we’re regularly asked which are the best routes to take for unbeatable views, unique locations, and a glimpse of jungle nature. Some travel agents and local tour operators organize guided trips if you’re not up for hiking independently.",
            "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/44/scuba-diving",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/44/scuba-diving",
                "anchor_text": "scuba diving"
              },
              {
                "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/7/2/nature",
                "anchor_text": "nature"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "All you need to hit the hiking trails on Koh Tao is a pair of trusty trainers or walking shoes and plenty of water, sunscreen, and mosquito repellant. Don’t forget to grab a map from your accommodation or one of the tourist information points before you set off. Alternatively, download a GPS app to your smartphone. Either way, it’s always a good idea to check in with a couple of island locals too. There’s a whole community of regular hikers who are usually more than happy to help with extra information on directions, turning points, and particular points of interest.",
            "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-blog/3/17/stay",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-blog/3/17/stay",
                "anchor_text": "accommodation"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "SOCIABLE ACCOMMODATION • ACTIVITIES AND EVENTS • SAFETY",
            "url": "https://visitkohtao.org/detail-sub/3/22/52/hiking/",
